@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
hide footbox
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "c:RideRosterCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute(commandText)
activate Logic
note over Logic, Command : Parsing succeeds and produces c (calls omitted).
Logic -> Command : getOverlapWarning(m)
Command --> Logic : empty string
note over Logic, Command : No overlapping commitment in this example.
Logic -> Command : execute(m)
activate Command
note right of Command
  Resolve ride and validate addition/removal.
  Copy roster and build immutable replacement.
end note
Command -> Model : setRide(ride, replacement)
Command --> Logic : result
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : book
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(book)
Storage --> Logic
[<-- Logic : result
deactivate Logic

legend bottom
  Successful addition or removal; getters and validation are described in prose.
  Observable refresh is shown separately. Saving errors do not roll back changes.
endlegend
@enduml
